      "subject": "fix(builder): settings role switcher, plan display, appearance sliders, destructive buttons, transform hand-off and surface refs (MS-2026-0006)",
      "body": "Real bugs: RoleSwitcher rendered ResetMockDataDialog without importing it, so development Settings threw (the dialog, removed as never loaded, is restored and imported, and its reset uses adminService.resetAllData; lib/seed has none); Pricing and Settings read a plan the usage snapshot does not have, leaving Current plan blank and Cancel always shown (the plan now comes from the plan role, ADR-0043); the appearance drawer's sliders showed fixed values and could not move (now bound to appearance state); five destructive confirms used a variant LuminaButton does not have (now danger); opening a transform in Designer threw on usageProvider, whose import alias was lost, and skipped activating the project; LuminaSurface dropped refs, so GlowCard's ripple never appeared (now forwardRef); the prompt typewriter's options had the wrong names. Latent: inspector header ignored its children, placeholder controls ignored their model, LuminaInspectorSection was dropped from the Lumina barrel by an export collision, LuminaBackground referenced a renamed variable. 54 type errors remain, all in Knowledge workspaces and tests; both UI contracts unchanged.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0006\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
